kickDecodeRunwayAssets no longer slice+sorts the full presentation list by
entityTimeToGlassSeconds. Select the two earliest (wave-first) eligible
ship/station starts in one pass. Also: hold-exempt type-gates dressing before
tGlass; reconcileMeshResidency caches time-to-glass across classify/sort/rehoist.

Portable microbench primary ~4.09× (400 entities / 24 ships); glass calls
2174→24 per iter. Focused decode/hold/wave/residency 42/42.
